1569_p0175a01","n":"0175a","t":"汝先說多瓶欲破一瓶更受多"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1569_p0175b01","n":"0175b","t":"有亦應更有相若更無相知有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1569_p0175c01","n":"0175c","t":"有分無故分亦無若有分未有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1569_p0176a01","n":"0176a","t":"遲見修妬路若眼去到色乃見"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1569_p0176b01","n":"0176b","t":"修妬路若意在身而色在彼色"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1569_p0176c01","n":"0176c","t":"見是事不然色有形故彼分中"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1569_p0177a01","n":"0177a","t":"風動相是四大非眼見者此所"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1569_p0177b01","n":"0177b","t":"外曰諸法非不住有不失故無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1569_p0177c01","n":"0177c","t":"果一故修妬路如土因泥果泥"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1569_p0178a01","n":"0178a","t":"取泥不取蒲若因中無果者亦"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1569_p0178b01","n":"0178b","t":"生復次若有瓶生若泥團後瓶"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1569_p0178c01","n":"0178c","t":"窮住壞亦如是若生住壞中更"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1569_p0179a01","n":"0179a","t":"因中果定故修妬路若因中先"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1569_p0179b01","n":"0179b","t":"然何以故若因中先無果者因"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1569_p0179c01","n":"0179c","t":"虛空是故遍信過去未來現在"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1569_p0180a01","n":"0180a","t":"雖不可現見以共相比知故信"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1569_p0180b01","n":"0180b","t":"方如是餘方隨日為名內曰不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1569_p0180c01","n":"0180c","t":"塵有形應有長短方圓等是故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1569_p0181a01","n":"0181a","t":"有誰當得者設有涅槃亦無得"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1569_p0181b01","n":"0181b","t":"修妬路畏名無力若人自於法"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1569_p0181c01","n":"0181c","t":"相待若少有不空應有相待若"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1569_p0182a01","n":"0182a","t":"語故不墮妄語我亦隨佛學故"}],"scheme":"cbeta","sl